OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe further spells of heavy rain
OL,7,Fspreading in from the southwest.
OL,8,FSoutherly winds will remain strong
OL,9,Fwith gale affecting the Irish Sea
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA mixture of bright spells
OL,13,Fand blustery showers, some heavy. A
OL,14,Fwindy day too with southwesterly gales
OL,15,Fand feeling cooler than Monday.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,18,Fmuch quieter end to the week with some
OL,19,Fshowers at times but also dry and
OL,20,Fbright weather. Still rather breezy at
OL,21,Ftimes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
